 "source": "snp-1-8-goodwill",
 "segmenter": "satsang-segment/1",
 "source_sha256": {
  "snp1-8": "df542450c56c591c5ab5167e4d19763cad2082b40e4f65f9dc89cb69489836ad",
  "copyright": "4232f371198d480eaee9a1f9d4122b3aa3727fb63e0e29f8e8b3cead61b96489"
 },
 "passages": [
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p1.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p1",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 37,
   "text": "(This sutta is identical with Khp 9.)",
   "sha256": "715fe395662030be",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    9
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p2.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p2",
   "start": 39,
   "end": 80,
   "text": "This is to be done by one skilled in aims",
   "sha256": "865abeaf42b07e76",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p3.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p3",
   "start": 82,
   "end": 114,
   "text": "appreciating the state of peace:",
   "sha256": "862abd10c256a65c",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p4.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p4",
   "start": 116,
   "end": 155,
   "text": "Be capable, upright, & straightforward,",
   "sha256": "02208a32aedbbcec",
   "kind_guess": [
    "instruction"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p5.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p5",
   "start": 157,
   "end": 199,
   "text": "easy to instruct, gentle, & not conceited,",
   "sha256": "d111466408edb5d5",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p6.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p6",
   "start": 201,
   "end": 227,
   "text": "content & easy to support,",
   "sha256": "c1568a2652f6c099",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p7.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p7",
   "start": 229,
   "end": 261,
   "text": "with few duties, living lightly,",
   "sha256": "f52760df59973a12",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p8.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p8",
   "start": 263,
   "end": 295,
   "text": "with peaceful faculties, astute,",
   "sha256": "aa01167235348d2b",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p9.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p9",
   "start": 297,
   "end": 331,
   "text": "modest, & no greed for supporters.",
   "sha256": "92c5da59d91d8c4f",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p10.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p10",
   "start": 333,
   "end": 362,
   "text": "Do not do the slightest thing",
   "sha256": "fc709d69ceca4d28",
   "kind_guess": [
    "instruction",
    "warning"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p11.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p11",
   "start": 364,
   "end": 403,
   "text": "that the observant would later censure.",
   "sha256": "819fc65a59b26d92",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p12.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p12",
   "start": 405,
   "end": 427,
   "text": "Think: Happy, at rest,",
   "sha256": "5a2ef6014e9feb6f",
   "kind_guess": [
    "instruction"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p13.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p13",
   "start": 429,
   "end": 462,
   "text": "may all beings be happy at heart.",
   "sha256": "0683e79b8e248bcb",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p14.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p14",
   "start": 464,
   "end": 493,
   "text": "Whatever beings there may be,",
   "sha256": "2472c3c259dea102",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p15.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p15",
   "start": 495,
   "end": 529,
   "text": "weak or strong, without exception,",
   "sha256": "c70594428b72f2f3",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p16.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p16",
   "start": 531,
   "end": 543,
   "text": "long, large,",
   "sha256": "502592bc58d4e1ce",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p17.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p17",
   "start": 545,
   "end": 561,
   "text": "middling, short,",
   "sha256": "b080f4ced68102f4",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p18.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p18",
   "start": 563,
   "end": 577,
   "text": "subtle, gross,",
   "sha256": "c386603ae8ba09b2",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p19.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p19",
   "start": 579,
   "end": 593,
   "text": "seen & unseen,",
   "sha256": "d4e9d6f5f18de45c",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p20.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p20",
   "start": 595,
   "end": 618,
   "text": "living near & far away,",
   "sha256": "feafea619c2738a1",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p21.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p21",
   "start": 620,
   "end": 642,
   "text": "born or seeking birth:",
   "sha256": "989ba228c98ed3b5",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p22.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p22",
   "start": 644,
   "end": 677,
   "text": "May all beings be happy at heart.",
   "sha256": "a765f5cf87dd9663",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p23.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p23",
   "start": 679,
   "end": 705,
   "text": "Let no one deceive another",
   "sha256": "ef13350444443e8a",
   "kind_guess": [
    "instruction"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p24.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p24",
   "start": 707,
   "end": 734,
   "text": "or despise anyone anywhere,",
   "sha256": "89c6db96e69ba739",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p25.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p25",
   "start": 736,
   "end": 779,
   "text": "or, through anger or resistance-perception,",
   "sha256": "68b05609eb33caa9",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p26.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p26",
   "start": 781,
   "end": 808,
   "text": "wish for another to suffer.",
   "sha256": "53cb0a012cd8282c",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p27.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p27",
   "start": 810,
   "end": 841,
   "text": "As a mother would risk her life",
   "sha256": "569e904f8d72f06d",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p28.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p28",
   "start": 843,
   "end": 880,
   "text": "to protect her child, her only child,",
   "sha256": "6eb5d11965023c7c",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p29.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p29",
   "start": 882,
   "end": 932,
   "text": "even so should one cultivate the heart limitlessly",
   "sha256": "80ef0ec45bc06079",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p30.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p30",
   "start": 934,
   "end": 961,
   "text": "with regard to all beings.1",
   "sha256": "a3ec4b5e893d9d94",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p31.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p31",
   "start": 963,
   "end": 999,
   "text": "With goodwill for the entire cosmos,",
   "sha256": "5a47ee9c6148c56c",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p32.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p32",
   "start": 1001,
   "end": 1033,
   "text": "cultivate the heart limitlessly:",
   "sha256": "5bc0b52a7194421a",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p33.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p33",
   "start": 1035,
   "end": 1062,
   "text": "above, below, & all around,",
   "sha256": "bdefb049c9d93efb",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p34.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p34",
   "start": 1064,
   "end": 1104,
   "text": "unobstructed, without hostility or hate.",
   "sha256": "6cfc74737cf383f5",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p35.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p35",
   "start": 1106,
   "end": 1132,
   "text": "Whether standing, walking,",
   "sha256": "5f5b58945ae114f6",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p36.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p36",
   "start": 1134,
   "end": 1157,
   "text": "sitting, or lying down,",
   "sha256": "c3ba66e8d2ea4c2c",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p37.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p37",
   "start": 1159,
   "end": 1194,
   "text": "as long as one has banished torpor,",
   "sha256": "a628f085a85240f6",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p38.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p38",
   "start": 1196,
   "end": 1242,
   "text": "one should be determined on this mindfulness.2",
   "sha256": "384fdc9b604d36dd",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1,
    2
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p39.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p39",
   "start": 1244,
   "end": 1275,
   "text": "This is called a Brahmā abiding",
   "sha256": "ec2c89a656e13c79",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p40.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p40",
   "start": 1277,
   "end": 1282,
   "text": "here.",
   "sha256": "dd1d122956efde29",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p41.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p41",
   "start": 1284,
   "end": 1305,
   "text": "Not taken with views,",
   "sha256": "9bdf17792b00de7e",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p42.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p42",
   "start": 1307,
   "end": 1343,
   "text": "but virtuous & consummate in vision,",
   "sha256": "c75f4d14d7aa9daa",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p43.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p43",
   "start": 1345,
   "end": 1381,
   "text": "having subdued greed for sensuality,",
   "sha256": "b3b66fa38c47ac34",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p44.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p44",
   "start": 1383,
   "end": 1398,
   "text": "one never again",
   "sha256": "9b4da388c54973e8",
   "kind_guess": [
    "warning"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p45.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p45",
   "start": 1400,
   "end": 1421,
   "text": "will lie in the womb.",
   "sha256": "af794b1dcbadf8bc",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p46.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p46",
   "start": 1423,
   "end": 1434,
   "text": "vv. 143–152",
   "sha256": "f6bb9b446a191783",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    143,
    152
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p47.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p47",
   "start": 1436,
   "end": 1441,
   "text": "Notes",
   "sha256": "8a7525b1492fb848",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": []
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p48.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p48",
   "start": 1443,
   "end": 1573,
   "text": "1. The image here is sometimes misconstrued as saying that one should protect all beings as a mother would protect her only child.",
   "sha256": "c77c60c418621750",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1,
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p48.s2",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p48",
   "start": 1574,
   "end": 1816,
   "text": "Actually, the parallel is not between the child and all living beings; it is between the child and one’s cultivation of the heart: One should protect one’s goodwill toward all beings in the same way that a mother would protect her only child.",
   "sha256": "01de678df5d2cd1e",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    1,
    1,
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p48.s3",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p48",
   "start": 1817,
   "end": 1842,
   "text": "On this point, see MN 21.",
   "sha256": "e80ff961bb17c434",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    21
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p49.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p49",
   "start": 1844,
   "end": 1965,
   "text": "2. This line has to be read in line with the Buddha’s definition of mindfulness as the ability to keep something in mind.",
   "sha256": "0afc55d45cae5ef4",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    2
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p49.s2",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p49",
   "start": 1966,
   "end": 1979,
   "text": "See SN 48:10.",
   "sha256": "cc93b1ddb2293e82",
   "kind_guess": [
    "description"
   ],
   "numbers": [
    48,
    10
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snp1-8:p50.s1",
   "segment": "snp1-8",
   "para": "p50",
   "start": 1981,
   "end": 2195,
   "text": "See also: MN 52; MN 97; MN 135; SN 42:8; SN 46:54; SN 55:7; AN 3:66; AN 4:67; AN 4:96; AN 4:125–126; AN 4:178; AN 4:200; AN 5:20; AN 5:27; AN 6:12–13; AN 8:70; AN 10:176; AN 10:196; AN 11:16; Ud 5:1; Iti 22; Iti 27",
   "sha256": "5ecf8cb75e87ac09",
